OL,3,GNEWSAShop owners upbeat despite
OL,4,A'devastating' break-in
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut her emotional post that morning on
OL,7,FFacebook reached thousands of people,
OL,8,Fand she said messages of support and
OL,9,Fvisitors to the shop had been pouring
OL,10,Fin ever since, convincing her the
OL,11,Fcommunity remained strong.
